# VHS tape for the README demo GIF.  Install: brew install vhs   Run: vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Output docs/demo.mp4

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1280
Set Height 640
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "export FORCE_COLOR=1 && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "npx blastgate demo"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 14s
